{"id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-covers.md","title":"沿序列的鞅成功","display":"df-covers — 沿序列的鞅成功","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-covers","aliases":["43-df-covers"],"display":"df-covers — 沿序列的鞅成功","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Definitions 10.1.1–10.1.2，印刷205–206，PDF225–226","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-covers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-covers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-covers — 沿序列的鞅成功"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Definitions 10.1.1–10.1.2，印刷205–206，PDF225–226"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\upharpoonright n\">\\(X\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> 是长度n前缀（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}\">\\(\\mathrm{Covers}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\">\\((2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\iff\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)&gt;k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\iff\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)&gt;k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这定义资本无界，也即limsup为无穷。它不要求资本收敛到无穷，更不要求可计算速度；三者不可混用。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Definitions 10.1.1–10.1.2，印刷205–206，PDF225–226。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$X\\upharpoonright n$ 是长度n前缀（see [[43-df-infseq]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Covers}","display":false},{"tex":"(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\iff\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)>k.","display":true}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[{"id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$d$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]，$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 见 [[43-df-covers]]。"},{"id":"b4a7907a385b0f04","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]；$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的有效编码解释；$\\mathrm{Martingale}$、$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 分别见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。有限二进制串、整数、有理数及其有限元组固定使用有效编码。下式的 $q$ 是全定义有理值函数。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-covers]] — 沿序列的鞅成功"},{"id":"12abc35e91616bca","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；可计算鞅、离散总计算、成功见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-covers]]。"},{"id":"8cfeb2a9ac08907d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；相关谓词见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。"},{"id":"786c9edad998bcfe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$d,g$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有效鞅与成功见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。"}],"outgoing":["565c3258eee2a5ff"]}